  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You may spend a reaction if a linked creature moves. As part of that reaction, you may move five feet each time the linked creature moves five feet, but no more total distance than your speed. You regain this reaction at the end of the creature's turn.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
